            the esAclExpertAccsRuleSrcPort as an operand which is the only one needed.

            When the value of this object is range(6) needs 2 operands. One is
            esAclExpertAccsRuleSrcPort, which is the starting port number of the
            range, and the other operand is esAclExpertAccsRuleSrcPortRange,
            which is the ending port number of the range.

            When the value of this object is mask(7) needs 2 operands. One is
            esAclExpertAccsRuleSrcPort, the other operand is esAclExpertAccsRuleSrcPortMask.

            This object is used for TCP/UDP protocol only, hence when the object
            'esAclExpertAccRuleProtocol' is set to other than TCP/UDP, the object has
            to be 'none(1)'."
